iderably less than Five Score), setting = somewhere in the South, General (or whatever) Werner Herzog of the fallen Empire = Imperial client Scavenger Lord.</div> </div> </div> </div>Liminal for Mando? I see Dragonblooded","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12378-fma245","name":"FMA245","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-04T01:15:58-08:00","id":1430961,"title":"","content":"I like the idea of Nexus as Gotham. Batman as a Night Caste Solar, Catwoman as his Changing Moon Lunar mate (with the whole love-hate thing going on), the Joker as a regular mortal possessed by one of the unshaped raksha, Harley Quinn his adopted daughter and girlfriend as an actual Fair Folk Princess and Two-Face as a mortal possessed by both an Eclipse Caste Solar and whatever the Infernal equivalent is fighting for control of his soul.<br /> <br /> This could totally work. What do you guys think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25665,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/","user":"Guest","date":". 01-04-2021, 04:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-04T07:12:10-08:00","id":1430983,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FMA245</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1430833-how-do-you-want-to-do-this-the-great-marriage-of-exalted-and-insert-fandom-here?p=1430959#post1